      "data": {
        "text": "\"Create submit_transcription.py in the current working directory.\nTask: submits an audio file for batch transcription.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b9787331001a3E1vZaRdutzMM",
